VALUES('96adbc98-0337-4251-960b-f84f00d6a6ae'::uuid,0, NULL, NULL, '<p>Casehead/Mother:&nbsp;Velma&nbsp;Moseley&nbsp;</p><p>DOB:&nbsp;04/13/95</p><p>Address:&nbsp;804&nbsp;Exeter&nbsp;Hall&nbsp;Ave&nbsp;</p><p>Baltimore,&nbsp;MD&nbsp;21218</p><p>Telephone:&nbsp;443-768-9666</p><p></p><p>Children:&nbsp;</p><p>Chavell&nbsp;Bell&nbsp;(alleged&nbsp;victim)</p><p>DOB&nbsp;03/05/22</p><p></p><p>Vermiya&nbsp;Mason-&nbsp;(information&nbsp;obtained&nbsp;using&nbsp;E&amp;E)</p><p>DOB:&nbsp;01/14/16</p><p></p><p>Quadir&nbsp;Curry-&nbsp;(information&nbsp;obtained&nbsp;using&nbsp;E&amp;E)</p><p>DOB:&nbsp;07/11/24</p><p></p><p>Other&nbsp;Adult&nbsp;(not&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;home)</p><p>Jay&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;(alleged&nbsp;maltreator)</p><p>DOB:&nbsp;unknown&nbsp;-&nbsp;approximately&nbsp;29&nbsp;years&nbsp;old&nbsp;</p><p>Address:&nbsp;unknown&nbsp;</p><p></p><p></p><p>On&nbsp;3/8/26,&nbsp;the&nbsp;agency&nbsp;was&nbsp;contacted&nbsp;regarding&nbsp;an&nbsp;incident&nbsp;involving&nbsp;4-year-old&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;Bell.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;shared&nbsp;that&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;was&nbsp;brought&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;pediatric&nbsp;emergency&nbsp;room&nbsp;for&nbsp;possible&nbsp;sexual&nbsp;abuse.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;went&nbsp;on&nbsp;to&nbsp;say&nbsp;Velma&nbsp;Moseley&nbsp;shared&nbsp;identified&nbsp;Jay&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;alleged&nbsp;maltreator.&nbsp;</p><p>The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;said&nbsp;that&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;had&nbsp;arrived&nbsp;at&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Mosley’s&nbsp;home&nbsp;while&nbsp;she&nbsp;was&nbsp;at&nbsp;work.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;said&nbsp;that&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Mosley’s&nbsp;10-year-old&nbsp;daughter&nbsp;and&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;were&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;home&nbsp;when&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;arrived.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>According&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;reporter,&nbsp;the&nbsp;10-year-old&nbsp;went&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;bedroom&nbsp;and&nbsp;observed&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;with&nbsp;his&nbsp;pants&nbsp;down&nbsp;and&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;have&nbsp;any&nbsp;underwear&nbsp;on.&nbsp;The&nbsp;10-year-old&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;witness&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;touching&nbsp;Chavell.&nbsp;The&nbsp;10-year-old&nbsp;called&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley&nbsp;and&nbsp;communicated&nbsp;what&nbsp;happened.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;said&nbsp;that&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley&nbsp;left&nbsp;work&nbsp;and&nbsp;went&nbsp;home.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;have&nbsp;an&nbsp;approximate&nbsp;time&nbsp;of&nbsp;when&nbsp;the&nbsp;incident&nbsp;occurred.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;did&nbsp;inform&nbsp;this&nbsp;writer&nbsp;that&nbsp;police&nbsp;were&nbsp;called&nbsp;however&nbsp;they&nbsp;had&nbsp;not&nbsp;arrived.&nbsp;When&nbsp;asked&nbsp;if&nbsp;there&nbsp;were&nbsp;any&nbsp;physical&nbsp;indicators&nbsp;of&nbsp;sexual&nbsp;abuse,&nbsp;the&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;responded&nbsp;that&nbsp;there&nbsp;were&nbsp;none&nbsp;and&nbsp;explained&nbsp;that&nbsp;a&nbsp;SAFE&nbsp;examination&nbsp;would&nbsp;be&nbsp;conducted.&nbsp;</p><p>When&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;was&nbsp;asked&nbsp;where&nbsp;she&nbsp;had&nbsp;been&nbsp;touched&nbsp;she&nbsp;pointed&nbsp;at&nbsp;her&nbsp;private&nbsp;area.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;know&nbsp;the&nbsp;name&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley’s&nbsp;10&nbsp;year-old&nbsp;child&nbsp;nor&nbsp;the&nbsp;name&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley’s&nbsp;other&nbsp;child.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p></p><p>The&nbsp;case&nbsp;is&nbsp;being&nbsp;screened&nbsp;in&nbsp;as&nbsp;an&nbsp;IR-Sexual&nbsp;abused&nbsp;and&nbsp;assigned&nbsp;to&nbsp;worker&nbsp;Jameria&nbsp;Davis,&nbsp;supervisor&nbsp;L.&nbsp;Forman&nbsp;and&nbsp;UM&nbsp;S.&nbsp;Otley&nbsp;in&nbsp;Division&nbsp;2.</p><p></p><p>Processed&nbsp;with&nbsp;Brittany&nbsp;Lee.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-09 07:25:21.182', '2026-08-04 18:19:44.699', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '0bdda2ab-b74f-4d74-ba17-3b9b37a9ca19'::uuid, '247a8b26-cdee-4ce8-b36e-b37e49fd0103'::uuid, NULL, '642f18b0-ef6e-4d4b-9871-acc0734f3f5a'::uuid, 