;10-year-old&nbsp;daughter&nbsp;and&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;were&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;home&nbsp;when&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;arrived.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>According&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;reporter,&nbsp;the&nbsp;10-year-old&nbsp;went&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;bedroom&nbsp;and&nbsp;observed&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;with&nbsp;his&nbsp;pants&nbsp;down&nbsp;and&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;have&nbsp;any&nbsp;underwear&nbsp;on.&nbsp;The&nbsp;10-year-old&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;witness&nbsp;Mr.&nbsp;Henderson&nbsp;touching&nbsp;Chavell.&nbsp;The&nbsp;10-year-old&nbsp;called&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley&nbsp;and&nbsp;communicated&nbsp;what&nbsp;happened.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;said&nbsp;that&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley&nbsp;left&nbsp;work&nbsp;and&nbsp;went&nbsp;home.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;have&nbsp;an&nbsp;approximate&nbsp;time&nbsp;of&nbsp;when&nbsp;the&nbsp;incident&nbsp;occurred.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;did&nbsp;inform&nbsp;this&nbsp;writer&nbsp;that&nbsp;police&nbsp;were&nbsp;called&nbsp;however&nbsp;they&nbsp;had&nbsp;not&nbsp;arrived.&nbsp;When&nbsp;asked&nbsp;if&nbsp;there&nbsp;were&nbsp;any&nbsp;physical&nbsp;indicators&nbsp;of&nbsp;sexual&nbsp;abuse,&nbsp;the&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;responded&nbsp;that&nbsp;there&nbsp;were&nbsp;none&nbsp;and&nbsp;explained&nbsp;that&nbsp;a&nbsp;SAFE&nbsp;examination&nbsp;would&nbsp;be&nbsp;conducted.&nbsp;</p><p>When&nbsp;Chavell&nbsp;was&nbsp;asked&nbsp;where&nbsp;she&nbsp;had&nbsp;been&nbsp;touched&nbsp;she&nbsp;pointed&nbsp;at&nbsp;her&nbsp;private&nbsp;area.&nbsp;The&nbsp;reporter&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;know&nbsp;the&nbsp;name&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley’s&nbsp;10&nbsp;year-old&nbsp;child&nbsp;nor&nbsp;the&nbsp;name&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ms.&nbsp;Moseley’s&nbsp;other&nbsp;child.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p></p><p>The&nbsp;case&nbsp;is&nbsp;being&nbsp;screened&nbsp;in&nbsp;as&nbsp;an&nbsp;IR-Sexual&nbsp;abused&nbsp;and&nbsp;assigned&nbsp;to&nbsp;worker&nbsp;Jameria&nbsp;Davis,&nbsp;supervisor&nbsp;L.&nbsp;Forman&nbsp;and&nbs